{%- comment -%}
  Minimal page template for advertorial pages on wellnessnest1.

  Why this file exists: the live theme has no default `templates/page.json`
  or `templates/page.liquid`, so every new page needs an explicit
  template_suffix mapped to a template file. Without it, pages 404 even
  when published_at is set.

  The body_html already contains the hide-theme-chrome CSS + JS at the top,
  so this template just outputs page.content with a full-width container.

  Note: `{% layout none %}` does NOT bypass theme.liquid on this store
  because GemPages intercepts at a higher level. Don't bother — let the
  body_html's hide-chrome CSS handle it.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="page-width" style="max-width:none;padding:0;">
  {{ page.content }}
</div>
